BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (mismatches, and an error in that last digit costs one penny per million dollars of revenue, so chasing it can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (burn hundreds or thousands of dollars to recover cents [tJr4jiz31fw @ 00:29:18]. Royalty Clerk draws the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (same line: an eighth-digit mistake does not matter, a fourth-digit mistake does.) Tj ET
