BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (decimal is worth $1,562.50 before taxes and deductions, while an order showing roughly half, 0.0078125,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm (pays about $781.25, a gap of $9,375 a year and $187,500 over a simplified 20-year illustration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm ([KYu7M4t5LAk @ 00:02:08]. Royalty Clerk shows how small errors compound: on 10,000 barrels at $70, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (right 0.0097656 decimal pays $683.59, but a decimal 2.7 percent low pays $665, leaving the owner $18.59) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (short every month on oil alone [blbomhUd0sA @ 00:02:22]. Payment timing is the other negotiable lever.) Tj ET
